    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The conduit possesses an inner reserve of restricted magic, known as their font. At 1st level, the conduit chooses a single font, granting them a unique esoterica to that font, and granting access to a number of wonders that are unique to that font. Once chosen, a font cannot be changed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/conduit#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
